r-name\">Jordy Vandeput</div>\n      <div class=\"teacher-specialty\">Filmmaker and Youtuber</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"teacher-spacer\"></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Testimonials -->\n<section class=\"testimonials\">\n  <h2>Why Students Love CreativeHub</h2>\n  <div class=\"testi-grid\">\n    <div class=\"testi-card\">\n      <p class=\"testi-quote\">\"CreativeHub was the best learning decision I've ever made… Real-world skills without the financial burden of traditional school.\"</p>\n      <div class=\"testi-author\">\n        <div class=\"testi-avatar grad-1\"></div>\n        <div class=\"testi-name\">Rachel R</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"testi-card\">\n      <p class=\"testi-quote\">\"I love that CreativeHub is a platform where I can find other creatives and we can support each other on our learning journey.\"</p>\n      <div class=\"testi-author\">\n        <div class=\"testi-avatar grad-2\"></div>\n        <div class=\"testi-name\">Elli V</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"testi-card\">\n      <p class=\"testi-quote\">\"It's rare that I subscribe for anything, but this is one subscription I can't imagine not having.\"</p>\n      <div class=\"testi-author\">\n        <div class=\"testi-avatar grad-3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"testi-name\">Katrina</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"testi-card\">\n      <p class=\"testi-quote\">\"CreativeHub helps me level up my skills, while also letting me explore… teachers bring vibrant personalities and valuable insights.\"</p>\n      <div class=\"testi-author\">\n        <div class=\"testi-avatar grad-4\"></div>\n        <div class=\"testi-name\">Savonne M</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Teams -->\n<section class=\"teams\">\n  <div class=\"teams-content\">\n    <h2>CreativeHub for Teams</h2>\n    <p>Set your team up for success with reimagined learning to empower their personal and professional growth. With inspiring classes