veHub membership begins. You'll be billed for the year in full, so you can enjoy continuous access to creative classes year-round.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n      <button class=\"accordion-header\">Can I teach on the platform?</button>\n      <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n        <p>Yes! CreativeHub teachers are everyday creatives and professionals who want to share their passion and the skills they've gained with a community of eager learners. Visit our Help Center to learn more.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Footer -->\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"footer-grid\">\n    <div class=\"footer-col\">\n      <h4>Art & Illustration</h4>\n      <a href=\"#\">Illustration</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Digital Art</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Drawing</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Painting</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Watercolor</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer-col\">\n      <h4>Graphic Design</h4>\n      <a href=\"#\">Graphic Design</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">UI/UX Design</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Type Design</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Surface Pattern Design</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Motion Design</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer-col\">\n      <h4>Creative Career</h4>\n      <a href=\"#\">Marketing</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Freelance</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">AI</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Productivity</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Social Media</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer-col\">\n      <h4>Film, Video & Photography</h4>\n      <a href=\"#\">Film Career</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Video Production</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Photography Technique</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Photography Editing</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Content Creation</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer-col\">\n      <h4>Software</h4>\n      <a href=\"#\">Procreate</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Adobe Illustrator</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">ChatGPT</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Blender</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Canva</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer-col\">\n      <h4>Company</h4>\n      <a href=\"#\">About</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Careers</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Press</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Blog</a>\n      <h4>Work With Us</h4>\n      <a href=\"#\">Affiliate Program</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Partnerships</a>\n      <h4>Teach With Us</h4>\n      <a href=\"#\">Become a Teacher</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Teacher Help Center</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\n    <p>&copy; 2026 CreativeHub. All rights reserved.</p>\n    <p style=\"max-width: 600px; text-align: right;\">All memberships billed automatically on a recurring basis until canceled. Cancel before trial ends to avoid being charged. Offer valid for new paid subscribers only.</p>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n<script>\n// Courses Data\nconst courses = [\n  {\n    title: \"Kickstart your Creativity with Procreate: 20 Fun Drawings for Beginners and Beyond\",\n    instructor: \"Lisa Bardot\",\n    students: \"24,872\",\n    duration: \"6h 24m\",\n    categories: [\"featured\", \"drawing-painting\", \"digital-illustration\"],\n    thumb: \"grad-1\"\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Social Media Content Creation in Canva: From Beginner to Advanced\",\n    instructor: \"Maggie Stara\",\n    students: \"44,495\",\n    duration: \"13h 19m\",\n    categories: [\"featured\", \"marketing\", \"social-media\", \"graphic-design\"],\n    thumb: \"grad-2\"\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Landscapes: A Free-Flow Watercolour Masterclass\",\n    instructor: \"Jane Davies\",\n    students: \"2,579\",\n    duration: \"1h 42m\",\n    categories: [\"featured\", \"drawing-painting\", \"fine-art\"],\n    thumb: \"grad-3\"\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Figma UI UX Design Advanced: Become a Pro\",\n    instructor: \"Daniel Scott\",\n    students: \"6,692\",\n    duration: \"8h 48m\",\n    categories: [\"featured\", \"ui-ux-design\", \"graphic-design\"],\n    thumb: \"grad-4\"\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"ChatGPT for Creatives: AI-Powered SEO, Marketing, & Productivity\",\n    instructor: \"Peggy Dean\",\n    students: \"18,842\",\n    duration: \"1h 18m\",\n    categories: [\"featured\", \"productivity\", \"marketing\"],\n    thumb: \"grad-5\"\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"How to Draw: A Beginner's Guide\",\n    instructor: \"Brent Eviston\",\n    students: \"26,243\",\n    duration: \"5h 57m\",\n    categories: [\"featured\", \"drawing-painting\", \"fine-art\"],\n    thumb: \"grad-6\"\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Learn Video Editing With Premiere Pro For Beginners\",\n    instructor: \"Jordy Vandeput\",\n    students: \"17,887\",\n    duration: \"3h 44m\",\n    categories: [\"featured\", \"film-video\", \"animation\"],\n    thumb: \"grad-7\"\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"iPhone Photography Essentials: Take Pro Photos With Your iPhone\",\n    instructor: \"Sean Dalton\",\n    students: \"13,423\",\n    duration: \"1h 34m\",\n    categories: [\"featured\", \"photography\", \"social-media\"],\n    thumb: \"grad-8\"\n  }\n];\n\nconst grid = document.getElementById('course-grid');\nconst tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.tab');\n\nfunction renderCourses(category) {\n  grid.innerHTML = '';\n  \n  let filtered = courses.filter(c => c.categories.includes(category));\n  if (filtered.length === 0) {\n    // Fallback if no exact match for demo purposes\n    filtered = [...courses].sort(() => 0.5 - Math.random()).slice(0, 4); \n  }\n  \n  filtered.forEach(c => {\n    const card = document.createElement('a');\n    card.href = \"#\";\n    card.className = 'course-card';\n    card.innerHTML = `\n      <div class=\"course-thumb ${c.thumb}\"></div>\n      <h3 class=\"course-title\">${c.title}</h3>\n      <div class=\"course-instructor\">${c.instructor}</div>\n      <div class=\"course-meta\">\n        <span>🧑‍🎓 ${c.students}</span>\n        <span>⏱ ${c.duration}</span>\n      </div>\n    `;\n    grid.appendChild(card);\n  });\n}\n\n// Initialize\nrenderCourses('featured');\n\ntabs.forEach(tab => {\n  tab.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    tabs.forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));\n    tab.classList.add('active');\n    renderCourses(tab.dataset.tab);\n  });\n});\n\n// FAQ Accordion\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.accordion-header').forEach(button => {\n  button.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const item = button.closest('.accordion-item');\n    const body = item.querySelector('.accordion-body');\n    const isActive = item.classList.contains('active');\n    \n    // Close all\n    document.querySelectorAll('.accordion-item').forEach(i => {\n      i.classList.remove('active');\n      i.querySelector('.accordion-body').style.maxHeight = null;\n    });\n\n    if (!isActive) {\n      item.classList.add('active');\n      body.style.maxHeight = body.scrollHeight + \"px\";\n    }\n  });\n});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
